<title>USA: Fort Worth, Texas $2.5 mln won by Coastal Sec..</title>
<headline>Fort Worth, Texas $2.5 mln won by Coastal Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Sec. said it won $2.5 million of Fort Worth, Texas, combination tax and revenue certificates of obligation Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.17 percent.</p>
</text>
